  from the effect of placebo.researchgate.net"}, {"study_index": 2, "title": "A double‐blind, randomized,               
  placebo‐controlled trial of fluoxetine in children and adolescents with depression", "abstract": "BACKGROUND          
  Depression is a major cause of morbidity and mortality in children and adolescents. To date, randomized, controlled,  
