  patients, 48 were randomized to fluoxetine treatment and 48 to placebo. Using the intent to treat sample, 27 (56%)    
  of those receiving fluoxetine and 16 (33%) receiving placebo were rated \\"much\\" or \\"very much\\" improved on     
